more than 470 000 americans have lost  their lives to covet 19 and  just under 5 000 of those deaths are  from here in clark county  so as we enter now year two of the  pandemic  thousands of others who've gotten sick  and survived are realizing that a full  recovery may be elusive  many battle a wide range of health  problems that is baffling doctors  fear and frustration in the face of  cobit  my chest hurts my back hurts my stomach  when i cough  spring 2020 nahama kravitz knocked down  by a bug  besides the obvious physical signs her  mental state wasn't right  i was on the phone with one of the  people on my team at work  and i couldn't remember words there were  words that i couldn't remember  one day i was taking a shower and i  could not breathe i had to kick the  shower open and i just passed out on the  floor and that's when i went back to the  hospital  carla washington and kravitz are just  two of the thousands of people  suffering from symptoms weeks and even  months later  there's a few terms for it post-covet  syndrome  long-covered long-hauler syndrome  dr silhan specializes in internal and  pulmonary medicine  she estimates about 10 percent of cobit  patients are what are now being called  long-haulers the most common are  breathlessness  exercising tolerance fatigue  some chest pain cough  she had all the official signs but the  diagnosis couldn't validate it  so when you got your test and it came  back negative  what was your reaction a part of me was  devastated to be honest the positive  test would have confirmed what she was  feeling  without it she felt lost i had a few  patients who  had mild to moderate symptoms for the  first two weeks and then week three  they were completely negative but then  they're actually sicker starting week  three this is a new thing we're seeing  the virus is unpredictable and  unforgiving  people who were seemingly healthy with  no underlying health conditions have  their bodies turn on them  suffering with long covet this is  seeming to happen  at least in my experience to people who  are otherwise extremely healthy and  young  in some the immune system just falls  apart  in others organs are targeted heart  failure  kidney disease are not uncommon but the  symptoms for a long hauler  swing so widely it's tough to nail down  it's been trying to figure out why i'm  having all these symptoms and  not getting a lot of answers although  there may not be clear answers there is  a community both women found it on  facebook by joining support groups  this is a real thing these are these are  people who are  all over the world who are writing about  the same exact symptoms  okay so i'm not crazy this is really  real like  you know i'm really not back to where i  am and other people  are going through the same thing  thousands of people worldwide and in  december congress authorized funding for  more research to study the prolonged  health consequences of long covet  it's a big enough problem that post  covid 19 care and rehab centers have now  opened at hospitals all across the  country
 

